(1. Scope. This procedure covers disputes raised by retail cardholders for debit and credit) Tj T*
(card transactions processed through the card schemes. It applies to branches, the contact) Tj T*
(centre and the mobile application.) Tj T*
T*
(2. Time limits. A cardholder must raise a dispute within 60 calendar days of the statement) Tj T*
(date on which the transaction first appeared. Disputes raised after 60 days are reviewed) Tj T*
(only if the cardholder demonstrates exceptional circumstances.) Tj T*
T*
(3. Provisional credit. For disputed amounts up to AED 5,000 the bank issues a provisional) Tj T*
(credit within 5 business days of receiving a complete dispute form. Amounts above AED 5,000) Tj T*
(require approval by the Card Operations Manager before provisional credit is granted.) Tj T*
T*
(4. Evidence. The cardholder provides the dispute form, a copy of the receipt where available) Tj T*
(and any correspondence with the merchant. Example record: cardholder e-mail) Tj T*
(cardholder.demo@example.com and IBAN AE45 0260 0010 1234 5678 901 must be redacted before) Tj T*
(analysis.) Tj T*
T*
ET
