(5. Chargeback. Card Operations submits the chargeback to the scheme within 10 business days) Tj T*
(of the provisional credit. If the merchant presents compelling evidence, the provisional) Tj T*
(credit may be reversed after notifying the cardholder in writing.) Tj T*
T*
(6. Fraud disputes. Where the cardholder reports that the card was lost or stolen, the card) Tj T*
(is blocked immediately and a replacement card is issued within 3 business days. Fraud cases) Tj T*
(are referred to the Fraud Risk Unit.) Tj T*
T*
(7. Escalation. Disputes that remain unresolved after 45 calendar days are escalated to the) Tj T*
(Head of Card Operations. Complaints about dispute handling follow the bank's consumer) Tj T*
(protection complaints procedure.) Tj T*
T*
